###

### Admin List Pending Applications
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/driver-applications/pending
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.token}}

###

### Admin Get Application Details
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/driver-applications/{{submitDriverApplication.response.body.$.data.applicationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.token}}

###

### Admin Verify Driver KYC
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/kyc/verify/{{loginDriver.response.body.$.userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "approved": true,
  "remarks": "Driver KYC approved by REST suite"
}

###

### Admin Approve Driver Application
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/driver-applications/{{submitDriverApplication.response.body.$.data.applicationId}}/review
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "approved": true,
  "remarks": "Driver application approved by REST suite"
}

###

### Login Driver Again To Refresh driverId
# @name loginDriverApproved
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{driverEmail}}",
  "password": "{{driverPassword}}"
}

###

### Driver KYC Status After Approval
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/kyc/status
Authorization: Bearer {{loginDriverApproved.response.body.$.token}}

###

### Driver Application Status After Approval
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/driver-applications/check
Authorization: Bearer {{loginDriverApproved.response.body.$.token}}
